# Exported session transcripts. `/export` writes them into whatever directory the session
# is in, which is the repo, and they are a verbatim record of the conversation rather than
# anything the project needs. Dated prefix so this cannot swallow a real data file: the
# requirements*.txt in this repo are tracked and stay tracked.
[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9]-*.txt
